{"unit_id":"LucienLL__dsh-session-status#card-zh","repo":"LucienLL/dsh-session-status","commit":"4a269f88650ac87cf90c344b1ebec2687b8608cd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-session-status**（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为每个 DSH 对话添加进行中、已结项、搁置中和自定义状态标签。它在会话头部注册状态控件与设置区，并在会话列表和悬停卡中展示状态。用户可以单击循环内置状态、从菜单选择或清除标签，也能管理自定义标签的名称、颜色和图标；标签及会话对应关系保存在 DSH settings 中。适合希望在多个对话间标记项目进度并快速识别会话的 Web 用户。使用前不需要额外配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:621-713","lib/client.js:950-979","lib/index.js:14-41"]}
{"unit_id":"LucienLL__dsh-session-status#card-en","repo":"LucienLL/dsh-session-status","commit":"4a269f88650ac87cf90c344b1ebec2687b8608cd","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**dsh-session-status** (DSH Web plugin): Adds built-in and custom labels to conversations. Users can cycle, choose, or clear a status from the header; labels also appear in session lists and hover cards. Settings manage custom names, colors, and icons. Mappings persist in DSH settings.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:621-713","lib/client.js:950-979","lib/index.js:14-41"]}
