{"unit_id":"LucienLL__dsh-session-status#feature-1","repo":"LucienLL/dsh-session-status","commit":"4a269f88650ac87cf90c344b1ebec2687b8608cd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-session-status** 的功能「会话头部状态切换」：在对话头部显示当前标签。单击状态 pill 循环进行中、已结项、搁置中和无状态；展开菜单可选择任意标签或清除。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:621-713"]}
{"unit_id":"LucienLL__dsh-session-status#feature-2","repo":"LucienLL/dsh-session-status","commit":"4a269f88650ac87cf90c344b1ebec2687b8608cd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-session-status** 的功能「会话列表状态点」：在列表会话标题前显示所选标签的图标和颜色。状态为空时不添加标记，界面变化后自动刷新列表展示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:364-389"]}
{"unit_id":"LucienLL__dsh-session-status#feature-3","repo":"LucienLL/dsh-session-status","commit":"4a269f88650ac87cf90c344b1ebec2687b8608cd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-session-status** 的功能「自定义状态标签」：设置页可添加、重命名或删除自定义标签，并选择图标和颜色。颜色支持预设色及十六进制输入，内置三态颜色也可单独调整。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:717-800","lib/status-store.js:20-45"]}
{"unit_id":"LucienLL__dsh-session-status#feature-4","repo":"LucienLL/dsh-session-status","commit":"4a269f88650ac87cf90c344b1ebec2687b8608cd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-session-status** 的功能「会话 hover 状态」：悬停会话行时，在 DSH hover 卡片中显示对应标签。插件按会话标题匹配唯一会话；无法唯一匹配时不插入状态行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:420-485"]}
